  "Open Settings \u2192 True Buddha Pedia Update \u2192 Release information to select releases.": "M\u1EDF C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t \u2192 C\u1EADp nh\u1EADt Tbpedia \u2192 Ph\xE1t h\xE0nh th\xF4ng tin \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn c\xE1c b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh.",
  "Overwrite all": "Ghi \u0111\xE8 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3",
  "Overwrite all applies to all remaining conflicting files in this update, including subsequent releases. Cancel stops the current release; earlier completed releases remain installed.": "Ghi \u0111\xE8 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c t\u1EC7p xung \u0111\u1ED9t c\xF2n l\u1EA1i trong b\u1EA3n c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt n\xE0y, bao g\u1ED3m c\u1EA3 c\xE1c b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh ti\u1EBFp theo. H\u1EE7y d\u1EEBng ph\xE1t h\xE0nh hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i; b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh ho\xE0n th\xE0nh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3 v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t.",
