  "Release ZIP is incomplete or corrupt ({0} bytes received). Retry the download or check the configured source.": "B\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh ZIP kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECB h\u1ECFng (\u0111\xE3 nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c byte {0}). H\xE3y th\u1EED t\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng l\u1EA1i ho\u1EB7c ki\u1EC3m tra ngu\u1ED3n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EA5u h\xECnh.",
  "Release archive contains a file and folder with the same path.": "Kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF ph\xE1t h\xE0nh ch\u1EE9a m\u1ED9t t\u1EC7p v\xE0 th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c c\xF3 c\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EABn.",
