  "Release archive exceeds the configured size limit.": "B\u1EA3n l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF ph\xE1t h\xE0nh v\u01B0\u1EE3t qu\xE1 gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EA5u h\xECnh.",
  "Release archive has an entry with no size metadata.": "Kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF ph\xE1t h\xE0nh c\xF3 m\u1ED9t m\u1EE5c kh\xF4ng c\xF3 si\xEAu d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u1EC1 k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc.",
  "Release archive has too many files.": "Kho l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF ph\xE1t h\xE0nh c\xF3 qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u t\u1EC7p.",
