  "Release manifest must be a JSON object.": "B\u1EA3n k\xEA khai b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng JSON.",
  "Release metadata is not valid JSON.": "Si\xEAu d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ph\xE1t h\xE0nh kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 JSON h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7.",
  "Release {0} contains duplicate or conflicting paths.": "B\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh {0} ch\u1EE9a c\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EABn tr\xF9ng l\u1EB7p ho\u1EB7c xung \u0111\u1ED9t.",
  "Release {0} depends on {1}, which must be an earlier release in this manifest.": "B\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh {0} ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c v\xE0o {1}, \u0111\xE2y ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 b\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh c\u0169 h\u01A1n trong b\u1EA3ng k\xEA khai n\xE0y.",
  "Release {0} dependsOn must be an array of unique release IDs.": "B\u1EA3n ph\xE1t h\xE0nh {0} dependsOn ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t d\xE3y ID ph\xE1t h\xE0nh duy nh\u1EA5t.",
  "Release {0} of {1}: {2}": "Ph\xE1t h\xE0nh {0} c\u1EE7a {1}: {2}",
